{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.poster.avif?t=1772542603\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.webm?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.mp4?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, an average human, crash-landed in an alien jungle. But you made it out alive, thanks to your trusty escape pod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you'll travel through the jungle in search of a city where you can (hopefully) launch back into space. Many trials and tribulations await! You'll face 33 unique levels and battle two guards before you're tested by our glorious empress <strong>DOHRA</strong> herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game plays like a brick breaker, but with your home galaxy at stake!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TILT THE GALAXY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To smaller brained humans, tilting the galaxy may seem impossible. But in <i>Paddlenoid</i>, curving spacetime is trivial. We bound this function to your controller, mouse, or keyboard, whatever your preference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curving spacetime alters the future of your pod, which the smaller brain  interprets as simply another way to guide your pod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.poster.avif?t=1772542603\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.webm?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.mp4?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player or two-player local (couch) coop.</strong>\u00a0Fight your SO for control of space-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tilt your galaxy to guide your escape pod.</strong>\u00a0A brick breaker with straight lines? What is this, the 80s?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with 3, 5, or 7 pods in reserve...</strong> Or in alternate realities.. same difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 different episodes with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</strong>\u00a0Test yourself against our glorious empress DOHRA!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An engaging story with multiple endings.</strong> In at least one of these endings, your species lives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're definitely not helping the alien fleet take control of our galaxy.</strong> Just felt like that should be clarified.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paddlenoid</i> was made by a typical human enterprise in a mid-sized concrete colony, working tirelessly to present you with amusing pocket realities. We're motivated solely by your enjoyment and the irresistible pull of Earth's currency. Paddlenoid was manufactured in just\u00a0<strong>274 Earth orbits</strong>\u00a0around its star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No humans were seriously harmed during the making of <i>Paddlenoid</i>. There's no reason to look into it further. Just use your brain to create entropy and endorphins.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... And don't forget to ignore the glitch crystals!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2789390?t=1772542603","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/7d59778382ca251f6894e531f6fbcf1c72b8138b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772542603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/57c79bcf263a1a56626a996847a86ce1c572e6eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772542603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/57c79bcf263a1a56626a996847a86ce1c572e6eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772542603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3713630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.poster.avif?t=1772542603\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.webm?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.mp4?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, an average human, crash-landed in an alien jungle. But you made it out alive, thanks to your trusty escape pod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you'll travel through the jungle in search of a city where you can (hopefully) launch back into space. Many trials and tribulations await! You'll face 33 unique levels and battle two guards before you're tested by our glorious empress <strong>DOHRA</strong> herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game plays like a brick breaker, but with your home galaxy at stake!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TILT THE GALAXY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To smaller brained humans, tilting the galaxy may seem impossible. But in <i>Paddlenoid</i>, curving spacetime is trivial. We bound this function to your controller, mouse, or keyboard, whatever your preference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curving spacetime alters the future of your pod, which the smaller brain  interprets as simply another way to guide your pod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.poster.avif?t=1772542603\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.webm?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.mp4?t=1772542603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player or two-player local (couch) coop.</strong>\u00a0Fight your SO for control of space-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tilt your galaxy to guide your escape pod.</strong>\u00a0A brick breaker with straight lines? What is this, the 80s?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with 3, 5, or 7 pods in reserve...</strong> Or in alternate realities.. same difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 different episodes with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</strong>\u00a0Test yourself against our glorious empress DOHRA!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An engaging story with multiple endings.</strong> In at least one of these endings, your species lives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're definitely not helping the alien fleet take control of our galaxy.</strong> Just felt like that should be clarified.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paddlenoid</i> was made by a typical human enterprise in a mid-sized concrete colony, working tirelessly to present you with amusing pocket realities. We're motivated solely by your enjoyment and the irresistible pull of Earth's currency. Paddlenoid was manufactured in just\u00a0<strong>274 Earth orbits</strong>\u00a0around its star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No humans were seriously harmed during the making of <i>Paddlenoid</i>. There's no reason to look into it further. Just use your brain to create entropy and endorphins.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... And don't forget to ignore the glitch crystals!</p>","developers":["Deadbug Projects"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/ea8a3ef1b993717f3968b2b256fc159b0f7c0af9/header.jpg?t=1772542603","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2789390/1616645473/c04747bde3b407335eeb71b8dd5489affdf3255b/1767027063/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767028832","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2789390/1616645473/c04747bde3b407335eeb71b8dd5489affdf3255b/1767027063/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767028832","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2789390/1616645473